WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:02,460
Now that everyone is here

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:04,460
How about starting big?

3
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:07,460
Okay, I have no objection

4
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:10,460
Zhang Lili

5
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:13,460
I heard that you have two top-notch prostitutes behind your back.

6
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:15,460
Even you have heard about it

7
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:17,460
It seems that they are quite famous indeed.

8
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:19,460
How did I hear

9
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:21,460
Your Zongmen Saint Son is a demon cultivator.

10
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:22,460
That's so right

11
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:24,460
The magic weapons all over his body are even more magical than those of a demon cultivator.

12
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:26,460
I think you want to be reincarnated

13
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:28,460
How dare you slander me, the Holy Son?

14
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:30,460
You look down on me

15
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:31,460
When did I look down on you?

16
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:32,460
What's going on with this madman?

17
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:33,460
Really dare to take action

18
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:36,460
And where did the magic weapon on his body come from?

19
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:37,460
You said I dare not take action

20
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:40,460
Doesn’t that mean you are looking down on me, brother?

21
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:41,460
That's not what I meant

22
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:42,460
I know you are awesome

23
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:43,460
Put me down quickly

24
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:44,460
Zhang Lili

25
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:45,460
You take care of your holy son

26
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:46,460
what does he want to do

27
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:47,460
in front of so many people

28
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:49,460
I can't help it even before the game starts.

29
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:51,460
I found a demon cultivator to be my saint son.

30
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:53,460
It's a good thing that the tracers are not trying to rebel, right?

31
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:54,460
look at his neck

32
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:55,460
It's none of your business, right?

33
00:00:55,460 --> 00:00:57,460
You want to dance too

34
00:00:57,460 --> 00:00:58,460
Stop it all

35
00:00:58,460 --> 00:01:00,460
What do they all sound like?
